{"title":"Career Roadmap · Coating Specialist","role":"Coating Specialist","summary":"A Coating Specialist in the pulp, paper and coating industry develops, optimizes, applies and troubleshoots coating formulations and coating processes used to modify the surface properties of paper and paperboard.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Pulp, Paper & Coating Technology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Coating Specialist in the pulp, paper and coating industry develops, optimizes, applies and troubleshoots coating formulations and coating processes used to modify the surface properties of paper and paperboard."},{"type":"p","text":"Coatings can improve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Printability"},{"text":"Smoothness"},{"text":"Gloss"},{"text":"Opacity"},{"text":"Brightness"},{"text":"Ink holdout"},{"text":"Water resistance"},{"text":"Grease resistance"},{"text":"Barrier performance"},{"text":"Surface strength"},{"text":"Functional performance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Paper Science","Polymer Chemistry","Colloid Science","Surface Chemistry","Coating Formulation","Process Engineering","Quality Control","Characterisation"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate profile should understand both what a coating formulation contains and how coating process conditions determine the final paper properties."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Tech/B.E. foundation"},{"text":"Pulp/paper science, coating chemistry, polymers, rheology and process engineering"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Coating Specialist / Junior Coating Engineer"},{"text":"Formulation, laboratory testing, coating trials and production troubleshooting"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"